block head
    title Rectal Prolapse - Plants Cause Disease

block content
    h1 Rectal Prolapse
    p Definition by #[a(href="https://www.mayoclinic.org/diseases-conditions/rectal-prolapse/symptoms-causes/syc-20352837") Mayo Clinic]:
    blockquote Rectal prolapse happens when part of the large intestine's lowest section, the rectum, slips outside the muscular opening at the end of the digestive tract known as the anus. While rectal prolapse may cause pain, it's rarely a medical emergency.
